{"lines": [{"text": "An AirTag has no GPS and no internet connection.", "start": 0.3, "end": 3.829}, {"text": "So how does it show up on a map, miles away?", "start": 3.979, "end": 6.579}, {"text": "It keeps sending out a short-range Bluetooth signal.", "start": 6.979, "end": 9.622}, {"text": "Any iPhone that walks past can hear it, even a stranger's.", "start": 9.972, "end": 13.515}, {"text": "That phone adds its own location, locks it so only you can read it, and sends it on.", "start": 13.815, "end": 19.141}, {"text": "Apple doesn't know who found it, or whose it is.", "start": 19.491, "end": 22.1}, {"text": "And the signal changes its ID about every fifteen minutes, so it can't be used to follow anyone.", "start": 22.45, "end": 28.087}, {"text": "Then your AirTag pops up on your map.", "start": 28.437, "end": 30.444}], "total": 30.444, "words": [{"w": "An", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.525, "line": 0}, {"w": "AirTag", "s": 0.525, "e": 1.006, "line": 0}, {"w": "has", "s": 1.006, "e": 1.295, "line": 0}, {"w": "no", "s": 1.295, "e": 1.519, "line": 0}, {"w": "GPS", "s": 1.519, "e": 1.808, "line": 0}, {"w": "and", "s": 1.808, "e": 2.097, "line": 0}, {"w": "no", "s": 2.097, "e": 2.321, "line": 0}, {"w": "internet", "s": 2.321, "e": 2.931, "line": 0}, {"w": "connection.", "s": 2.931, "e": 3.829, "line": 0}, {"w": "So", "s": 3.979, "e": 4.157, "line": 1}, {"w": "how", "s": 4.157, "e": 4.387, "line": 1}, {"w": "does", "s": 4.387, "e": 4.667, "line": 1}, {"w": "it", "s": 4.667, "e": 4.846, "line": 1}, {"w": "show", "s": 4.846, "e": 5.126, "line": 1}, {"w": "up", "s": 5.126, "e": 5.304, "line": 1}, {"w": "on", "s": 5.304, "e": 5.483, "line": 1}, {"w": "a", "s": 5.483, "e": 5.61, "line": 1}, {"w": "map,", "s": 5.61, "e": 5.967, "line": 1}, {"w": "miles", "s": 5.967, "e": 6.299, "line": 1}, {"w": "away?", "s": 6.299, "e": 6.579, "line": 1}, {"w": "It", "s": 6.979, "e": 7.14, "line": 2}, {"w": "keeps", "s": 7.14, "e": 7.439, "line": 2}, {"w": "sending", "s": 7.439, "e": 7.829, "line": 2}